      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "我が都には、出世を狙って仕官の口を求める者や、\n闘技場で名をあげたい者など、国中の猛者が集まる。\n勇猛で結構なことだが、血の気が多く争いも絶えん。\n美しい舞で彼らの心を鎮めてやってもらえないか？",
        "official_en": "The mightiest warriors from across the country\ngather in our capital to advance their careers or to\nprove themselves in our arena. They're brave—but\ncombative. Would you calm them with a dance?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
