      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "興奮しすぎた荒くれが舞台に上がろうとしたが\nあんた、そいつを一撃でのしてて格好良かったな！\n警備の不手際は詫びるが、見惚れてしまったよ。\nこれからも応援させてもらう。また寄ってくれ！",
        "official_en": "Great job taking out that rascal who tried to get up\non the stage! Apologies for the security hiccup, but\nI'll say that you really impressed everyone. We'll be\nwatching your career with eagerness.",
        "real_en": null
      },
